# A local mirror of the androidx.xr.glimmer sources, kept for reference while
# translating. It is Google's code under Apache 2.0, not ours, so it is not
# committed and not published. Recreate it with tool/fetch_reference.dart.
reference/

# The upstream sources, read while working on the kit. Google's code under
# Apache 2.0, not ours, in a repository that is MIT and public. It must never
# be committed, and neither must the note of what was read from it.
doc/google_androidx/
doc/reference.md
